title: "Thermograph: experimental combinatorial-game values and approximate thermography"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Nicholson
    given-names: Devin
repository-code: "https://github.com/devinnicholson/thermograph"
url: "https://github.com/devinnicholson/thermograph"
abstract: >-
  A Rust research prototype for exact dyadic-number arithmetic, stable
  structural game-tree payloads, named infinitesimals, and approximate
  floating-point thermography of finite normal-play combinatorial games.
keywords:
  - combinatorial game theory
  - thermography
  - surreal numbers
  - reproducible research
